=== STEP 2: tuning (TRAIN only) ===
  tuning on TRAIN only: 66 rows, 21 positives, 66 sessions; GroupKFold(5) by session, test-fold positives [6, 4, 6, 3, 2]; n_iter=15
  logistic regression gets a wider search: n_iter=60 over C in [1e-4, 100], l1_ratio (L2..L1) and class_weight
  NOTE: with this little data the CV score of each candidate is noisy, so picking the best of 15 candidates mostly fits noise. A tuned set is kept only if it gains >= 0.01 CV PR-AUC.
